 Charging mandate. To meet this requirement, the office worked with the AWS account team and AWS Partner ScaleCapacity to build an AI-driven Race-Blind Charging solution on AWS. With this solution, the District Attorney\u0026#39;s Office achieved compliance in six months, can now automatically redact sensitive data from case documents, and can thoroughly test and deploy any new redaction rule changes in less than a week.\u003cspan style\u003d\"display:none\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"display:none\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/Contra%20Costa%20County%2070x70px.5145886dbc12ce6761b8932e487bbb161b756712.png","displayLocation":"United States","footerInfoText":"2025","industry":"General Public Services","sortDate":"2025-02-14","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/contra-costa-county-district-attorney-scalecapacity/","customer-name":"Contra Costa County District Attorney\u0027s Office","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2025","contentType":"Case Study","headline":"Contra Costa County District Attorney\u0027s Office Makes Unbiased Charging Decisions with ScaleCapacity Generative AI Solution on AWS"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#product#bedrock","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Bedrock","description":"Amazon Bedrock","dateCreated":"2023-04-13T19:06:46+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-13T19:06:46+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#ses","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Simple Email Service (SES)","description":"Amazon Simple Email Service (SES)","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:22+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:33:00+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#s3","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Simple Storage Service (S3)","description":"Amazon Simple Storage Service (S3)","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:09+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:58+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#namer","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"North America","description":"North America","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:03+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:34+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#ai-ml","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Machine Learning \u0026 AI","description":"Machine Learning \u0026 AI","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:22+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#united-states","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"United States","description":"United States","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:08+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:34+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#dynamodb","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon DynamoDB","description":"Amazon DynamoDB","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:48+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:31+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#textract","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Textract","description":"Amazon Textract","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:47+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:33:04+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#general-public-services","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"General Public Services","description":"General Public Services","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:04+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#cognito","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Cognito","description":"Amazon Cognito","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:17+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:25+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#case-study","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Case Study","description":"Case Study","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#mercado-libre-mutt-data-2025","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"mercado-libre-mutt-data-2025","dateCreated":"2025-02-06T19:03:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2025-05-17T00:14:47+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"\u003cp\u003eMercado Libre has partnered with AWS Partner Mutt Data to address the challenge of producing high-performing banner ads with generative artificial intelligence (AI), for dozens of thousands of smaller sellers. Mercado Libre developed GenAds, an innovative solution that automates the creation of compelling product images, streamlining the process for sellers and enhancing their market presence with image-generating AI. Through GenAds, Mercado Libre helped small sellers through image generation for advertising, enabling sellers of all sizes to attract customers, increase click-through rates (CTR) by an average of 25%, and boost sales effectively.\u003c/p\u003e\n","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/Mercado%20Libre%2070x70px.3099765060d5a58a491aa00a98fb1ec1885dc0e2.png","displayLocation":"Argentina","footerInfoText":"2025","industry":"Retail","sortDate":"2025-02-06","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/mercado-libre-mutt-data/","customer-name":"Mercado Libre","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2025","contentType":"Case Study","headline":"Mercado Libre Reshapes Retail Media with AWS Partner Mutt Data and Stability AI in Amazon Bedrock"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#product#dynamodb","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon DynamoDB","description":"Amazon DynamoDB","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:48+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:31+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#ai-ml","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Machine Learning \u0026 AI","description":"Machine Learning \u