":"adidas-innovator-en","dateCreated":"2024-09-20T20:43:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-09-20T23:23:09+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"The largest sportswear manufacturer in Europe and multibillion-dollar brand, adidas and its three-stripe logo are recognized around the globe. Established in 1949, the company is driven by the belief that sports has the power to change lives. Its mission today is to build a digital foundation to increase agility and deliver superior products and experiences to adidas customers. Using Amazon Web Services (AWS), the athletic apparel designer and retailer is accelerating enterprise-wide transformation. It is developing and deploying applications 40-times faster, improving business operations by automating enterprise resource planning (ERP) using AWS for SAP, and making innovation an everyday event for its fitness tracking subsidiary Runtastic.","featured":"0","featureImageURL":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/customer-references-case-studies-logos/ASSET_ADIDAS_345x230.4b53568962599b68e64a41e731298e8de237415a.jpg","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/executive-insights/logo-adidas-200x100.060c98680530efce6a269cd0d3ba7b28ca5035bf.jpg","displayLocation":"Germany","customerNameLower":"adidas","footerInfoText":"Published Date","description":"\u003cp\u003eAnalyzing trends and predicting future product offerings.\u003c/p\u003e\n","industry":"Manufacturing","sortDate":"2024-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/innovators/adidas/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"adidas","publishedDate":"2024","enableShare":"1","headline":"Adidas on AWS","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise","description":"Enterprise","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:39:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-05T01:27:39+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#databases","locale":"en_