8:10+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"\u003cp\u003eLeader de la comparaison en ligne des offres et des contrats d\u0026rsquo;\u0026eacute;nergie, Selectra passe \u0026agrave; la vitesse sup\u0026eacute;rieure en garantissant \u0026agrave; ses clients un niveau de service optimal et en offrant \u0026agrave; ses d\u0026eacute;veloppeurs une infrastructure parfaitement ma\u0026icirc;tris\u0026eacute;e et \u0026agrave; m\u0026ecirc;me de soutenir la croissance de l\u0026rsquo;entreprise. La souplesse de Kubernetes alli\u0026eacute;e \u0026agrave; la performance des services Amazon Web Services lui permet de d\u0026eacute;velopper de nouvelles lignes de service tout en soulageant ses \u0026eacute;quipes techniques de lourdes t\u0026acirc;ches de maintenance et de supervision.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","featured":"0","featureImageURL":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Selectra-IMG%40500px.85c46673665805f9bb35720b9dcc6b5afe1c3606.png","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/customer-references-case-studies-logos/Selectra-logo%402x.366ad1cfcfe69b9e73a6046e52dcda36357d68c0.png","displayLocation":"France","customerNameLower":"selectra","footerInfoText":"Date de publication","industry":"Logiciels et Internet","sortDate":"2023-01-08","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/fr/solutions/case-studies/selectra-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Selectra","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2022","contentType":"Témoignages clients","headline":"Selectra se dote d’une infrastructure alliant performance et sérénité grâce à AWS"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#databases","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Databases","description":"Databases","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:27+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#case-study","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Case Study","description":"Case Study","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:20+0000","dateUpdated":"20