 learning (ML) progress to create game-changing customer experiences. By using AWS to modernize its data and ML infrastructure, the company freed up its data scientists and tripled its speed to delivery, helping to direct more resources to customers.","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/intuit-logo%401x.abf7c40ea61ce4d0953ca761007c94e44fb36e58.png","displayLocation":"United States","customerNameLower":"intuit","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Software \u0026 Internet","sortDate":"2022-08-22","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/intuit-ml-summit-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Intuit","publishedDate":"2022","enableShare":"1","headline":"Intuit Modernizes AI and ML on AWS to Derive Customer Benefits","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#product#kinesis-data-firehose","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Kinesis Firehose","description":"Amazon Kinesis Firehose","dateCreated":"2020-05-08T03:42:48+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:46+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise","description":"Enterprise","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:39:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-05T01:27:39+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#dynamodb","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon DynamoDB","description":"Amazon DynamoDB","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:48+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:31+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#serverless","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Serverless","description":"Serverless","dateCreated":"2021-07-28T18:46:39+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#glue","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Glue","description":"AWS Glue","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:03:4