our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can use the AND operator to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#bit-soft-case-study","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"bit-soft-case-study","dateCreated":"2021-09-18T02:19:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-11T23:51:23+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"With Amazon Web Services (AWS), Bit Soft Romania increased availability to 99.95 percent. Bit Soft is a Romanian company that provides digital solutions to the hotel, restaurant, and café (HORECA) industry. Migrating to AWS allowed Bit Soft to ensure constant security and availability of its services and customer data.","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/bit-soft-logo%401x.3f13ed9b92dc819b186cd84be24457622d178cdc.jpg","displayLocation":"Romania","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Professional Services","sortDate":"2021-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/bit-soft-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Bit Soft","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2021","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Bit Soft Video Testimonial"}},"tags":[{"id":"customer-references#category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:28+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-12T02:01:30+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US"