Service (S3)","description":"Amazon Simple Storage Service (S3)","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:09+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:58+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#storage","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Storage","description":"Storage","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:35+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#codemantra","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"codemantra","dateCreated":"2021-12-14T02:50:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-14T23:32:51+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"codemantra leverages the Batch Transform feature of Amazon SageMaker and Amazon SageMaker Multi-Model Endpoints to reduce the time and cost required for machine learning (ML)–powered document processing. It is an intelligent document processing company that uses software and deep learning to automate workflows and achieve accessibility compliance. The company is using Amazon SageMaker for concurrent document processing at scale, AWS Lambda to invoke batch processing, and Amazon S3 to store documents and ML predictions.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/apac/customer-references-logos-(%401x---%402x)/Codemantra_logo%401x.d2dbf49087ce17f6bc264b7b98bf17548c84afa1.png","displayLocation":"India","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Software \u0026 Internet","sortDate":"2021-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/codemantra/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2021","customer-name":"codemantra","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"codemantra Helps Businesses Improve Digital Document Accessibility with AI-Powered Platform on AWS"}},"tags":[{"id":"customer-references#category#batch-processing","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Batch Processing","description":"Batch Processing","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:02+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-26T01:35