tory around how AWS can provide the most comprehensive set of data capabilities spanning databases, analytics, business intelligence, and machine learning for an end-to-end data strategy.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2024-02-14T22:32:15+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-02-14T22:32:15+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#autodesk-big-data-processing","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"autodesk-big-data-processing","dateCreated":"2020-11-12T18:43:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-19T03:04:47+0000","additionalFields":{"featured":"0","descriptionSummary":"Autodesk is a leading software provider in 3D design for architecture, engineering, manufacturing, media, and entertainment industries. The Autodesk Data Platform (ADP) collects and processes product usage data, providing Autodesk\u0027s operating teams with a product analytics platform. By migrating from a Spark-based processing system to AWS Lambda, Autodesk saves up to 90 percent in data processing costs annually. Today, Autodesk is able to process data in near real-time, providing timely analytics for business users to leverage for product improvements and other business opportunities.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/autodesk-logo-2022%401x.c2c78e83fe77cfbe57e586f0465bf8f70e5089ce.png","displayLocation":"Asia Pacific","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Software \u0026 Internet","sortDate":"2020-11-12","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/autodesk-big-data-processing/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Autodesk","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2020","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Autodesk Reduces Big Data Processing Cost by 90% using AWS"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#product#lambda","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Lambda","description":"AWS Lambda","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:04:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:46+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL