e","description":"\u003cp\u003eLG Electronics launches \u001cLG ThinQ,\u001d a global artificial intelligence brand offering products and services equipped with artificial intelligence technology. LG ThinQ with artificial intelligence evolves while learning the surrounding environment, ultimately providing optimized functions for the user\u0026#39;s active space. LG Electronics has built an IoT platform that can service LG ThinQ through AWS IoT Core and AWS Managed Services.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","industry":"Electronics \u0026 Semiconductors","sortDate":"2019-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/lg-electronics/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"LG Electronics","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2019","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"AWS Case Study: LG Electronics"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#product#lambda","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Lambda","description":"AWS Lambda","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:04:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:46+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#iot-core","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS IoT Core","description":"AWS IoT Core","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:04:00+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:42+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#databases","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Databases","description":"Databases","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:27+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId"