ghts and reveal the unknown for the benefit of humankind.\" To better share its achievements with the public, NASA turned to InfoZen, an Advanced Consulting Partner of the AWS Partner Network (APN). NASA\u0027s new Image and Video Library , built on AWS, provides easy access to more than 140,000 still images, video, and audio—all in one place, from virtually any device.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/NASA_Customer-Reference_Logo.1eb226249f11fb52edf971ad051fee19c89ff0b2.png","displayLocation":"Americas","footerInfoText":"Published Date","description":"\u003cp\u003eRead the NASA customer case study, powered by the AWS cloud. AWS provides cloud computing services to hundreds of thousands of companies.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","industry":"Government","sortDate":"2017-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/nasa-image-library/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"NASA","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2017","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"AWS Case Study: NASA"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#elastic-transcoder","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Elastic Transcoder","description":"Amazon Elastic Transcoder","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:03:07+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:34+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#cloudformation","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS CloudFormation","description":"AWS CloudFormation","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:01:55+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:22+0000"}