ed States, Kansas City takes advantage of a public-private partnership to build out a sophisticated network of sensors and access points for big-data insights.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/case-studies/600x400%20Kansas_City_Logo.0653eb367abefecce61e82b104d8edb6f6b63fdf.jpg","displayLocation":"Americas","footerInfoText":"Published Date","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe City of Kansas City connected its smart city infrastructure with Xaqt on AWS, enabling it to create powerful predictive models that improve quality of life and reduce costs\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","industry":"Government","sortDate":"2017-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/kansas-city/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Kansas City with Xaqt","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2017","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Kansas City with Xaqt Case Study"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#product#lambda","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Lambda","description":"AWS Lambda","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:04:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:46+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#redshift","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Redshift","description":"Amazon Redshift","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:02+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:56+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#cloudformation","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS CloudFormation","description":"AWS CloudFormation","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:01:55+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:22+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0000"},{